  "description": "Gives Claude deep knowledge of the Jamdesk documentation platform — 25+ MDX components with full props and examples, complete docs.json configuration schema, 8 navigation patterns, 19 CLI commands, and writing standards. Claude loads only the reference sections relevant to each task, keeping context efficient.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, `jamdesk` (Comprehensive reference for building Jamdesk documentation sites) and **1 MCP server**, `Jamdesk`.\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install jamdesk@claude-community` from `jamdesk/jamdesk-claude-plugin`.\n\nA Claude Code plugin for building Jamdesk documentation sites. Gives Claude deep knowledge of Jamdesk components, configuration, navigation patterns, and CLI commands — so you can build docs faster with AI assistance.",
